{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S03、S08、S11、S12等较短段落里，话句与定时感受交替较密，错过出现时点后不如X的静态词条容易补看。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把每段叙述和相邻感受按顺序对应起来，【】突出人物心理的关键转折，即使不仔细读完，也比较容易抓住这一段发生了什么、为什么发生。定时感受进一步把情绪落实到具体音色、节奏、动作和身体反应上，让音乐与人物心理形成更细腻的联系；X虽然可以自由扫读静态词条，但感受与叙述的对应关系需要观众自己拼接，部分心理和音乐细节也显得比较泛。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6e00e5c5-46b5-4298-82d9-0c1d24d06cb6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T232400773007Z", "elapsed_seconds": 79.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:25:20.684614+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "27e424b3476f9b80a1062663a6d0fe21e96199e875a12b64de7fc429b6c8d817", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":